menu "e32p: ota"

    config E32P_OTA_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_ota (over-the-air firmware update)"
        default n
        help
            Firmware update over esp_ota_ops + esp_https_ota: query the running
            slot / app version / image size, control rollback, stream an image
            into the next slot from any source, or pull one from an HTTP(S) URL.
            Requires an OTA-capable partition table (otadata + ota_0/ota_1) — the
            platform's default partitions.csv provides one. The query and rollback
            layer is unit-tested offline; the download path needs a network.

endmenu
